        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4d2f88e3-6841-3ada-8f39-d6d833a19eae",
                "word": "hectare",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d723f86c-c794-4328-ab03-a92560adf4d7",
                        "entry_id": "4d2f88e3-6841-3ada-8f39-d6d833a19eae",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "hectares"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "80937421-c419-37ec-9b36-3328c1733cec",
                        "entry_id": "4d2f88e3-6841-3ada-8f39-d6d833a19eae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Unité de mesure de superficie en dehors du Système international (mais dont l’usage est accepté avec le SI), valant cent ares, et dont le symbole est ha."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e16c2a8d-757c-474e-b495-becb8f8b07f5",
                                "sense_id": "80937421-c419-37ec-9b36-3328c1733cec",
                                "text": "On trouve aussi des vignes dans les communes de Suzanne, Tourteron, Guincourt , Neuville-et-Day. Ces quatre communes en contiennent environ 140 hectares produisant, année moyenne, 12,400 hectolitres de vin de médiocre qualité."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af0d35df-0037-4e5d-8a95-7e605d8da889",
                                "sense_id": "80937421-c419-37ec-9b36-3328c1733cec",
                                "text": "Pessan, le siège d’une antique abbaye, a une superficie de 2588 hectares où végètent encore 430 habitants."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce13cade-0b1a-4f58-89ee-a86c2ca48a94",
                                "sense_id": "80937421-c419-37ec-9b36-3328c1733cec",
                                "text": "La superficie des communes d’Attigny, Sainte-Vaubourg, Coulommes-et-Marqueny, Chuffilly-Roche donne comme ordre de grandeur plus de trois mille cinq cents hectares."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b535587-f222-4cd9-a472-e35b3fb35a4e",
                                "sense_id": "80937421-c419-37ec-9b36-3328c1733cec",
                                "text": "La plus grande métairie en superficie était Mauvy : 140 hectares environ, mais la surface labourable ne représentait que 18 % des terres (25 hectares), car l'essentiel était constitué de bruyères (72 hectares), de pâtures (24 hectares) et de taillis (14,3 hectares)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "252e4e6d-f7d3-44fe-9e51-7a2f596fa106",
                        "source_entry_id": "4d2f88e3-6841-3ada-8f39-d6d833a19eae",
                        "source_sense_id": "80937421-c419-37ec-9b36-3328c1733cec",
                        "target_lang_word": "Hektar",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Hektar",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73af3b96-e45d-317f-9487-837b3c4394bc",
                                        "entry_id": "83cef08b-323c-3736-aaaa-249012798e96",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Flächenmaß, das 100 Ar oder 10 000 Quadratmetern entspricht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93b8fa75-d218-4e30-a2de-696dc570f464",
                                                "sense_id": "73af3b96-e45d-317f-9487-837b3c4394bc",
                                                "text": "Sie wollte dasselbe und fünfhundert Hektar des umliegenden Landes bis zu ihrem Lebensende für sich behalten. (Max Eyth: Der Tartarenrebell hinter dem Dampfpflug)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cee6fa9-b2fd-4700-8406-4db31dc04fc5",
                                                "sense_id": "73af3b96-e45d-317f-9487-837b3c4394bc",
                                                "text": "„Neben den handelsüblichen sächsischen Weinen bietet er eine selbstgekelterte Hausmarke an, die auf seinem etwa einen Hektar großen Weinberg gleich hinter seinem Gasthof reift.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca249e60-32af-44dc-8e4e-882fa72cd9e3",
                                                "sense_id": "73af3b96-e45d-317f-9487-837b3c4394bc",
                                                "text": "„Die Artenvielfalt soll hier auf einem Hektar höher sein als in ganz Europa.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aed17d8d-c8d7-48f3-84b8-adb1fd1ca617",
                                                "sense_id": "73af3b96-e45d-317f-9487-837b3c4394bc",
                                                "text": "„Es bestehe aus einem Pachthof von achtunddreißig Hektar mit einer Art Schloß und einem sehr ertragreichen Garten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3d32c1b-6460-44bd-8611-f1e253bc5b0b",
                                                "sense_id": "73af3b96-e45d-317f-9487-837b3c4394bc",
                                                "text": "„Der Stablack ist eine weitläufige, hügelige Landschaft, in die hinein zehn Jahre zuvor, 1934, ein riesiger Truppenübungsplatz mit einer Fläche von 10000 Hektar gebaut worden war.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "79df2206-ee35-4324-8245-e4e281a7feaf",
                        "source_entry_id": "4d2f88e3-6841-3ada-8f39-d6d833a19eae",
                        "source_sense_id": "80937421-c419-37ec-9b36-3328c1733cec",
                        "target_lang_word": "hectare",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hectare",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "850e68c6-0d07-30b8-a85e-cb1be4ef3700",
                                        "entry_id": "40d2e494-0afc-3cab-a8b7-6288d2c3aaea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A unit of surface area (symbol ㏊) equal to 100 ares (that is, 10,000 square metres, one hundredth of a square kilometre, or approximately 2.5 acres), used for measuring the areas of geographical features such as land and bodies of water."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2dcb1a0-7db6-47f1-9da9-f6dcb4cf9ad1",
                                                "sense_id": "850e68c6-0d07-30b8-a85e-cb1be4ef3700",
                                                "text": "With careful planning almost anyone can turn the dream of owning a small farm or a few hectares of country land into a reality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4931e24-d29c-4956-ac71-c00a9bd0efd5",
                                                "sense_id": "850e68c6-0d07-30b8-a85e-cb1be4ef3700",
                                                "text": "One hectare (about 2.5 acres) of forest cleared and converted to ranchland or crops produces a piece of land worth, on average, $200 to $500."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3cb02b7-430c-44ae-9807-2593a28ccdbd",
                                                "sense_id": "850e68c6-0d07-30b8-a85e-cb1be4ef3700",
                                                "text": "Last year 1m square metres of plant-covered roofing was built in France, as much as in the US, and 10 times more than in Germany, the pioneer in this field. In Paris 22 hectares of roof have been planted, out of a potential total of 80 hectares."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
